            "><div class="relative min-w-10 h-10"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/svg/icon-achievement-polymarket.svg"/></div><p class="text-sm">Polymarket Signal 74% Win Rate</p></div><div class="h-20 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg
              
            "><div class="relative min-w-10 h-10"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/svg/icon-achievement-virtuals.svg"/></div><p class="text-sm">Integrated with Virtuals ACP</p></div><div class="h-20 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg
              
            "><div class="relative min-w-10 h-10"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/svg/icon-achievement-base-app.svg"/></div><p class="text-sm">Building on BASE App</p></div></div></div><div class="relative w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col gap-10 justify-center items-center px-4 sm:px-10"><div class="max-w-4xl flex flex-col gap-8 items-center text-center"><p class="blur-text text-3xl text-ufo-green flex flex-wrap justify-center"><span class="font-unison-pro-bold" style="display:inline-block;will-change:transform, filter, opacity;filter:blur(10px);opacity:0;transform:translateY(-50px)">The<!-- --> </span><span class="font-unison-pro-bold" style="display:inline-block;will-change:transform, filter, opacity;filter:blur(10px);opacity:0;transform:translateY(-50px)">new<!-- --> </span><span class="font-unison-pro-bold" style="display:inline-block;will-change:transform, filter, opacity;filter:blur(10px);opacity:0;transform:translateY(-50px)">era<!-- --> </span><span class="font-unison-pro-bold" style="display:inline-block;will-change:transform, filter, opacity;filter:blur(10px);opacity:0;transform:translateY(-50px)">of<!-- --> </span><span class="font-unison-pro-bold" style="display:inline-block;will-change:transform, filter, opacity;filter:blur(10px);opacity:0;transform:translateY(-50px)">betting</span></p><p class="text-center leading-8">In traditional betting, you place your bet and that’s it. You rarely know who’s actually winning big, how often they win, or what’s happening behind the scenes. The future is different. The future is<!-- --> <span class="text-ufo-green font-bold">Prediction Markets</span>   betting powered by blockchain, where every move is recorded transparently and nothing is hidden. That’s why we built <!-- --> <span class="text-ufo-green font-bold">AIxBET Smart Money Terminal</span>. Clean way to see winners, know the numbers, and react instantly.</p></div><div class="absolute w-full h-[600px] -z-10 opacity-20"><div class="relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden "></div></div></div><div class="min-h-screen grid place-content-center"><div class="w-full xl:w-7xl max-w-7xl m-auto py-10"><p class="blur-text text-3xl text-ufo-green flex flex-wrap justify-center"><span class="font-unison-pro-bold" style="display:inline-block;will-change:transform, filter, opacity;filter:blur(10px);opacity:0;transform:translateY(-50px)">Features</span></p><p class="mt-4 text-center px-4">Your edge in Prediction Markets: AI automation, profit sharing, signals, and smart money analytics.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 grid-rows-2 gap-6 m-4 mt-10"><div class="row-span-2 p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-400/10 bg-linear-to-br from-ufo-green/10 to-ufo-green/30 space-y-4"><div class="w-full rounded-xl overflow-clip"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1140" height="1425" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fterminal-signal.9a723c41.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fterminal-signal.9a723c41.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fterminal-signal.9a723c41.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><a target="_blank" href="https://terminal.aixbet.ai/"><button class="flex justify-center items-center gap-1 font-bold font-unison-pro-bold outline-none rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl transition cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 text-black bg-ufo-green text-xs sm:text-sm py-3 lg:py-4 px-5 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-10 w-full undefined">Go to Terminal »</button></a></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-400/10 bg-linear-to-br from-ufo-green/10 to-ufo-green/30 space-y-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/agent.svg"/><h3 class="text-lg text-ufo-green">Autonomous AI Agent</h3><p class="text-sm">The core engine behind AIxBET’s ecosystem. It works around the clock, scanning markets, executing trades, and adapting instantly — generating the profits that power our community’s passive income.</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-400/10 bg-linear-to-br from-ufo-green/10 to-ufo-green/30 space-y-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/signal.svg"/><h3 class="text-lg text-ufo-green">Prediction Market Signals</h3><p class="text-sm">Daily, high-accuracy signals built from real-time market data, predictive models, and whale tracking. Get clear, actionable calls on when and where to place your bets.</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-400/10 bg-linear-to-br from-ufo-green/10 to-ufo-green/30 space-y-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/profit-sharing.svg"/><h3 class="text-lg text-ufo-green">Profit Sharing Mechanism</h3><p class="text-sm">Lock $AXB to earn points and receive a share of 70% of Alpha Pool profits in stablecoins. The longer you lock, the bigger your multiplier, with added perks like exclusive terminal access.</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-400/10 bg-linear-to-br from-ufo-green/10 to-ufo-green/30 space-y-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/smart-money.svg"/><h3 class="text-lg text-ufo-green">Smart Money Analytics</h3><p class="text-sm">Track top traders, study their strategies, and see where the profits come from. With our Copy-Trade Agent, you can mirror AIxBET’s master wallet in real time, non-custodial, and fully automated.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="min-h-screen grid place-content-center"><div class="w-full max-w-svw xl:w-7xl xl:max-w-7xl py-10"><p class="blur-text text-3xl text-ufo-gr